                "stays under the 640K ceiling — the ceiling stood at " +
                "512K through the 70-cast town; wave 6's 98 citizens " +
                "and the 220-text inbox saturate honestly larger, " +
                "every grown record capped (got ${vetJson.length})")
        check(vetJson.length > 407_923,
