        "photo: the enlargement read on its plate's behalf, untested — the form is still in its office")
    for (id in listOf("stuart_edge", "carol_memory", "album_weather"))
        Mystery10.grantClue10(sPlay, id)
    check(Mystery10.pendingFrame10(sPlay)?.id == "frame_album",
