        "photo: the morning the form becomes readable, the enlargement's standing reading is refuted by it — no edit, no re-read; context is a kind of paperwork")
    check(Mystery10.pendingFrame10(sPlay)?.id == "frame_enlargement" &&
        Mystery10.chooseCall10(sPlay, "frame_enlargement", "misfiled") &&
        Mystery10.frameVerdict10(sPlay, frames10[2]) == "PROVEN",
