        !Mystery10.chooseFinale10(sDue10, "name"),
        "photo: one call is taken, once; afterwards the rehanging is done asking")
    val out10 = Mystery10.resolveHanging(sDue10)
    check(sDue10.arc10Retired && sDue10.arc10Branch == "complete" &&
