        bdaySrc.contains("\"bdayShare\""),
        "shared gathering: the module stands whole — " +
            "observances, the arbitration sentence, the " +
            "player-sharing sentence, and both stamps")
    val newsSrc = File(root,
        "src/com/hunt3r/southparktown/Newspaper.kt").readText()
    check(newsSrc.contains("Birthdays.sharedDayLine(state, week)"),
        "shared paper: the edition calls the shared-day " +
            "line beside the week's birthday list")
    // no new TalkGate rail, no new agenda seat: the gate
    // still enumerates eleven rails and Engine still
